WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.300
Welcome back to Building
HR-Driven Identity.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:09.013
This is Chapter 3: joiner workflows as
code, and the Temporary Access Pass bridge.

3
00:00:09.013 --> 00:00:12.687
A workflow edited in the portal
is a change nobody reviewed.

4
00:00:12.687 --> 00:00:16.148
A workflow kept as a file
is one a reviewer can read,

5
00:00:16.148 --> 00:00:20.451
a test can lint, and a plan can
turn into exactly one new version.

6
00:00:20.451 --> 00:00:25.092
We'll start from Microsoft Learn's
procedure, then see what the kit adds:

7
00:00:25.092 --> 00:00:29.413
the workflow files, a lint, a plan,
and a measure of day-one readiness.

8
00:00:29.413 --> 00:00:31.820
Then two labs and the dangers.
